## 1. Frozen Certification Criteria (All 6 Required)

1. Compiler driver executes in pure .oo without bash loop scripts.
2. Topological module resolution handles all ~218 modules deps-first.
3. Source Merkle CAS cache (input_fp) eliminates Stage 2 cold rebuild invalidation.
4. Stage 1 (S0 -> S1), Stage 2 (S1 -> S2), and Stage 3 (S2 -> S3) compile cleanly.
5. Bit-identical binary parity: SHA-256(S1) == SHA-256(S2) == SHA-256(S3).
6. Double-run test suite passes with zero divergence (Run 1 == Run 2 = 0).

